result
result-*

# Secrets (NEVER commit these)
*.key
*.pem
*_rsa
*_ed25519
*.gpg
*secrets*
*_secrets*
secrets/
# …but a secretspec.toml declares WHICH secrets exist, never a value — it is
# meant to be committed, and `*secrets*` above would eat it. This machine has
# no such file today; the negation stays so adding one back just works.
!secretspec.toml
.env
.envrc

